"_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117850#pullrequestreview-4015160638"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117850"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-26T15:18:21Z","commit_id":"f04e57b2d3c21bc8b344f9c5caa39895f8da5249"},{"id":4015344730,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7vVUxa","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?u=0565b5d99d54afd5fda6712cd8eb05893572baed&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Looks good to me, but we should probably add some comments:\n\n1. (`VariantInternal`) That `object_assign_without_ref_unsafe()` should be used with extreme caution.\n2. (VM) That destructors for fixed addresses aren't called because `Variant`s are initialized with `object_assign_without_ref_unsafe()`.\n\nSafety rests on several assumptions. One of them is that fixed addresses are never written to, only read. My biggest concern was `NIL`, but after examining the code, I think this assumption is correct (see also #117863). For coroutines everything should be fine too, as far as I understand.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117850#pullrequestreview-4015344730","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117850","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117850#pullrequestreview-4015344730"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117850"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-26T15:43:54Z","commit_id":"f04e57b2d3c21bc8b344f9c5caa39895f8da5249"},{"id":4015512275,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7vV9rT","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?u=b7882c94f408976a2f79e8fe6e1ce27fbd48db74&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117850#pullrequestreview-4015512275","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117850","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117850#pullrequestreview-4015512275"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117850"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-